        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Iud Dei XVI 3.2" corresp="#wit-co"><pb n="428" ed="#liebermann"/>Et sicut igne illuminasti<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="4" target="#IudDeiXVI_3-2.lnote.oe.4"/> Moysen, ita nunc<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="5" target="#IudDeiXVI_3-2.lnote.oe.5"/> illumina corda nostra et sensus nostros, ut ad uitam eternam peruenire mereamur. Per</ab>
